    { math: '1 · The plateau is where experts live', note: 'The intermediate plateau (the vocabulary lesson\'s curve) is not the end — it\'s the beginning of the expert game: precision, register control, cultural fluency. Progress continues, but the metrics change from quantity to quality.' },
    { math: '2 · Fossilised errors need surgery', note: 'Long-standing errors (wrong prepositions, fossilised word order) resist input. Fixes: error-specific drilling, recording and self-diagnosis, and deliberate practice with immediate correction (the memory lesson\'s targeted retrieval).' },
